{"author_date": "2026-08-25T23:35:31Z", "author_login": "imreddyTeja", "commit_date": "2026-08-25T23:35:31Z", "committer_login": "web-flow", "message": "Patch release 0.3.4 (#61)\n\n* Patch release 0.3.4\n\nThis patch release updates the CUDA compat.\nThe breaking changes between CUDA.jl v5 and v6\nshould not impact this package at all. I also updated\nthe deps in the buildkite manifest, and updated it to use\njulia 1.12.5\n\n* Update github actions", "sha": "07e2272e9c627f11ff739f5171872561d140e0a2"}
{"author_date": "2026-11-03T18:01:52Z", "author_login": "imreddyTeja", "commit_date": "2026-11-03T21:55:08Z", "committer_login": "imreddyTeja", "message": "Fix support for julia 1.12 and 1.13\n\nThis is done by lowering into a special lowering module.\nUnbound names get assigned to that module, and then the module is later\nremoved from the name", "sha": "fece1fd3e6acb360b2358e3f3a9e1d6ec4b13e50"}
